subtrack (subtrack v{VERSION})

View and manage the audit log

USAGE:
  subtrack [COMMANDS] <OPTIONS>

COMMANDS:
  [audit] <OPTIONS>       View and manage the audit log
  list <OPTIONS>          List audit log entries
  prune <OPTIONS>         Prune old audit log entries

For more info, run any command with the `--help` flag:
  subtrack audit --help
  subtrack audit list --help
  subtrack audit prune --help

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help             Display this help message
  -v, --version          Display this version

